Package: greencrypt
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${python3:Depends},
 python3-pycryptodome,
Description: AES-256-EAX file and folder encryption tool (CLI)
 GreenCrypt encrypts and decrypts files and folders with AES-256 in EAX
 mode. Every file gets a random 16-byte salt and nonce, and the key is
 derived with PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256 (200000 iterations).
 .
 This package provides the shared cryptographic core, the command-line
 interface and the interactive menu.

Package: greencrypt-gui
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${python3:Depends},
 greencrypt (= ${binary:Version}),
 python3-pyside6.qtwidgets,
Description: AES-256-EAX file and folder encryption tool (Qt GUI)
 GreenCrypt encrypts and decrypts files and folders with AES-256 in EAX
 mode. Every file gets a random 16-byte salt and nonce, and the key is
 derived with PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256 (200000 iterations).
 .
 This package provides the Qt (PySide6) graphical interface.
